            {
                "entry_id": "c8f5cfab-ba75-31ed-8be3-a5fb2e5d6d1d",
                "word": "bloomers",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c1d46367-9bc8-4e93-844a-fb42db7f0e79",
                        "entry_id": "c8f5cfab-ba75-31ed-8be3-a5fb2e5d6d1d",
                        "tags": [
                            "attributive"
                        ],
                        "form": "bloomer"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6aa21690-c953-3c23-9804-7311429658f5",
                        "entry_id": "c8f5cfab-ba75-31ed-8be3-a5fb2e5d6d1d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of several forms of women’s divided garment for the lower body."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "097358cd-b770-4de7-b7a3-3ffe8b743674",
                                "sense_id": "6aa21690-c953-3c23-9804-7311429658f5",
                                "text": "Fanny, knowing this, had made up her mind to go straight to Horn & Udell. Now, Horn & Udell are responsible for the bloomers your small daughter wears under her play frock, in place of the troublesome and extravagant petticoat of the old days."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98ecf2b2-158c-4f96-9494-41b1862bc443",
                                "sense_id": "6aa21690-c953-3c23-9804-7311429658f5",
                                "text": "Moreover, the family realized perfectly that Alix would have clipped her thick hair, and taken to bloomers or knickerbockers outright, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f40bd996-df6d-40f5-aa4e-03260b96b37a",
                                "sense_id": "6aa21690-c953-3c23-9804-7311429658f5",
                                "text": "Yet so radioactive were her nerves[…] that she was more energetic than any of the hulking young women who, with calves bulging in heavy-ribbed woolen stockings beneath decorous blue serge bloomers, thuddingly galloped across the floor of the “gym” in practise for the Blodgett Ladies' Basket-Ball Team."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6471082-0879-4336-9c00-4055d41c27dd",
                                "sense_id": "6aa21690-c953-3c23-9804-7311429658f5",
                                "text": "Ladies’ grey flannelette bloomers, three shillings a pair, astonishing bargain. Plain and loved, loved for ever, they say."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f399453d-9ced-418e-a014-598851d1191e",
                                "sense_id": "6aa21690-c953-3c23-9804-7311429658f5",
                                "text": "But the truth was, her pantaloons came down to her ankles, and when she got the leg of one caught in a twig, she nearly fainted [...] \"If you will be in these sort of adventures, you should wear bloomers.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "14db8364-76a3-339d-aa36-1df6540a864f",
                        "entry_id": "c8f5cfab-ba75-31ed-8be3-a5fb2e5d6d1d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Women’s underpants with short legs; knickers or drawers."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal",
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "47f3b504-de4e-4a65-83b4-db7df1ae216e",
                        "source_entry_id": "c8f5cfab-ba75-31ed-8be3-a5fb2e5d6d1d",
                        "source_sense_description": "Women’s underpants with short legs.",
                        "target_lang_word": "bloomer",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bloomer",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "288aeea1-b4ba-3d7a-a43d-aa7f9b74e680",
                                        "entry_id": "979c44af-3894-3736-ad4b-8eb1646e4a07",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sorte de culotte bouffante, proche du sarouel utilisée par les femmes à la fin du XIXᵉ siècle pour faire du vélo et remis au goût du jour pour les enfants dans les années 1930."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Anglicism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd2c53e1-6a6c-42c2-8541-4cb645a7a664",
                                                "sense_id": "288aeea1-b4ba-3d7a-a43d-aa7f9b74e680",
                                                "text": "Entravées par leur jupe à tournure, elles portent le bloomer, une jupe-culotte bouffante qui leur permet de chevaucher les “bécane”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3583669c-444a-45c8-9a1c-28a8a15bf0e4",
                                                "sense_id": "288aeea1-b4ba-3d7a-a43d-aa7f9b74e680",
                                                "text": "… et en bas un bloomer, une sorte de culotte bouffante. Pour ajouter à ma honte, la mienne était serrée alors qu'elle aurait dû être large."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c1c1fe2-f73d-3e40-9278-1f70041d6935",
                                        "entry_id": "979c44af-3894-3736-ad4b-8eb1646e4a07",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Short-culotte féminin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Anglicism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f04f404-7ad4-4186-abb1-c42cf80a15a6",
                                                "sense_id": "2c1c1fe2-f73d-3e40-9278-1f70041d6935",
                                                "text": "Un bloomer est un short-culotte féminin (utilisé aussi par les hommes pour son côté pratique) d'athlétisme ou de volleyball, très court et moulant en tissu synthétique ou éponge (mais rare)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
